{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:53:35+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demons Happened", "steam_appid": 1992020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Demons Happened is a fast paced action/puzzler with an enemy possession mechanic. Grab a demon, exploit its powers, fling it to the next one, and chain your kills in a perfect execution of your master plan... or miss a step, improvise, and quickly recover with a creative solution.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcrafted Levels</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/c1c48597f44e796d1aedf79e2246bcc1.poster.avif?t=1661548883\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/c1c48597f44e796d1aedf79e2246bcc1.webm?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/c1c48597f44e796d1aedf79e2246bcc1.mp4?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Try, fail, wing it, and try again until you bring your plan to perfection, all in the span of a few seconds. Set in a world where rent prices seem unaffected by humanity's demise, bite-size, handcrafted levels unfold in a series of challenges where every fight is a puzzle, and your enemies become the tools to overcome any obstacle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Your Enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/3f376338fda74174740ed263f00951db.poster.avif?t=1661548883\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/3f376338fda74174740ed263f00951db.webm?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/3f376338fda74174740ed263f00951db.mp4?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Possess everybody else's demons to confront and use a variety of powers. Shoot from a safe distance with passive-aggressiveness, explode with repressed anger, shield yourself with overprotectiveness, stop time with your stress, and pet some very cute rats spawned by cowardice, nice and fluffy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/a2a2efa1122663dac1889c42ffb29a77.poster.avif?t=1661548883\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/a2a2efa1122663dac1889c42ffb29a77.webm?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/a2a2efa1122663dac1889c42ffb29a77.mp4?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Control your enemies to overcome your obstacles<br></li><li> 8 enemies with vastly different skills, from ricocheting bullets to time stopping<br></li><li> More than 100 bite-size levels, a mix of action, puzzle, and skillful dodging<br></li><li> Collectibles for an extra challenge<br></li><li> Two endings<br></li><li> A protagonist dead inside AND outside</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "Demons Happened is a fast paced action/puzzler with an enemy possession mechanic. Grab a demon, exploit its powers, fling it to the next one, and chain your kills in a perfect execution of your master plan... or miss a step, improvise, and quickly recover with a creative solution.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcrafted Levels</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka