63dac1889c42ffb29a77.poster.avif?t=1661548883\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/a2a2efa1122663dac1889c42ffb29a77.webm?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/extras/a2a2efa1122663dac1889c42ffb29a77.mp4?t=1661548883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Control your enemies to overcome your obstacles<br></li><li> 8 enemies with vastly different skills, from ricocheting bullets to time stopping<br></li><li> More than 100 bite-size levels, a mix of action, puzzle, and skillful dodging<br></li><li> Collectibles for an extra challenge<br></li><li> Two endings<br></li><li> A protagonist dead inside AND outside</li></ul>", "short_description": "Demons Happened is a challenging top down shooter/puzzler with an enemy possession mechanic, about a dead-inside ghost on a journey to fix his tv.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Demons Happened is a curious blend of very rapid action faintly reminiscent of Hotline Miami, and an Abe's Oddysee type of puzzle game. Such disparate genres don't often blend as well as this, and I'm disappointed that it hasn't got a bigger reception.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/header.jpg?t=1661548883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1661548883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1661548883", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-6700HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong